  "limitations": [
    "The predictive function used in the IPSO algorithm is a distance-based method premised on the hypothesis that the user has a similar degree of preference for similar material collocation solutions, requiring further study of the relationship between visual characteristics of materials and human preference.",
    "The prototype system was verified and validated by graduate students and research staff members, not targeted homebuyers, which limits the generalizability of the findings to the actual end-user group.",
    "The study shares a common limitation with all other VR-related research in terms of the difference between IVR and the physical environment."
